OL,6,     FYour weekly guide to the best
OL,7,     Fmovie soundtracks with Edith
OL,8,     FBowman. Jess Gillam reveals her
OL,9,     FPick of the Flicks, and Harry
OL,10,     FEscott presents this week's
OL,11,     FHarmonising Hollywood.
OL,12,G1700 This Classical Life
OL,13,     FJess Gillam is joined by kora
OL,14,     Fplayer Seckou Keita to swap some
OL,15,     Fof their favourite music,
OL,16,     Fincluding Fela Sowande, Ella
OL,17,     FFitzgerald, Saint-Saens,
OL,18,     FMussorgsky and Faada Freddy.
